    '批发订单适用与零售一致的质量与物流责任条款，另适用：正常范围内损耗不支持退货（例如运输导致的可熨烫褶皱、轻微线头、约定色差/公差内的批次差异）。确认的质量问题须按件/按批次提供凭证，经确认后按责任范围处理，不以「整单无理由」方式退货。详见「退换政策」。' => [
        'ar_SA' => 'طلبات الجملة تتبع نفس قواعد الجودة/الناقل للتجزئة، إضافة: الاستهلاك الطبيعي ضمن التسامح غير قابل للإرجاع. مشاكل الجودة المؤكدة تتطلب أدلة قطعة/دفعة. راجع سياسة الإرجاع.',
        'bg_BG' => 'Wholesale orders follow the same quality and carrier-responsibility rules as retail, plus: normal in-range wear is not returnable (e.g. ironable transit wrinkles, minor threads, batch color variance within agreed tolerance). Confirmed quality issues require per-piece/batch evidence and are handled by responsibility scope—not as whole-order no-reason returns. See the Returns Policy.',
        'bn_BD' => 'Wholesale orders follow the same quality and carrier-responsibility rules as retail, plus: normal in-range wear is not returnable (e.g. ironable transit wrinkles, minor threads, batch color variance within agreed tolerance). Confirmed quality issues require per-piece/batch evidence and are handled by responsibility scope—not as whole-order no-reason returns. See the Returns Policy.',
